<title>USA: NBA-Monday's second-round playoff results.</title>
<headline>NBA-Monday's second-round playoff results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second-round National Basketball Association playoff games on Monday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>Eastern Conference semifinals</p>
<p> NEW YORK	   89  Miami		76</p>
<p>(New York leads best-of-seven series 3-1)</p>
<p>Western Conference semifinal</p>
<p> UTAH		 98  LA Lakers	  93 (OT)</p>
<p>(Utah wins best-of-seven series 4-1)</p>
</text>
